From afde911099ed581d9f68567e30401b9a24e35f8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 14:29:40 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] ci(cut): run the release gate on its own runner label
 camcraft-cut

[self-hosted, linux] matched every post-merge runner (labels match
case-insensitively), so a release gate could land on an 8-thread
laptop. cut.yml now asks for [self-hosted, camcraft-cut]; the cut
runner carries that label. Merge only after a runner has it.

Fixes #3253

